data: {"id": "f87a645fc1e248be-thinking-parallel_evidence-1574", "run_id": "f87a645fc1e248be", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集到以下关键事实，用于判断 `CrashLoopBackOffRuntime` 的直接原因：\n\n### 1. 身份确认\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx`\n- **UID**: `52361280-45fe-4ec1-a8f0-292e82b90b8c`\n- **容器**: `app` (Image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`, Command: `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`)\n\n### 2. 状态与异常确认\n- **Phase**: `Running` (但容器持续重启)\n- **Status**: `CrashLoopBackOff`。`kubectl describe` 确认了 `Warning BackOff`，`restarts` 计数已达 7（甚至 13，视 Prometheus 采样而定），说明异常仍在持续。\n- **Reason**: `exitCode=78` (应用层错误退出)。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788444793264, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

